WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:02.400
And now, it's time for...

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.180
confessions!

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.860
What could you possibly mean?

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.700
Perhaps she means confessing to one's crush?

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.090
Huh? Crush?

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:13.690
You gotta make time for juicy confessions at a sleepover!

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.700
You do?

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.740
Sleepovers are a fearsome event.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.720
Okay, Alice goes first!

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.840
Is that a Selfish?

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.640
No.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:27.540
It's my father.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:29.010
{OP}

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:35.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.580
Every day it sparkles

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:46.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:53.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:58.830
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:09.920
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:15.620
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:24.500
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:26.160
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.570
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:31.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.200
What's more than just cute

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:38.070
is our promise between girls

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:44.110
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:50.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.070
Father!

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.910
Welcome home!

00:01:57.910 --> 00:01:59.270
Oh, Alice!

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:03.100
My goodness, haven't you grown big!

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.160
I don't believe I've changed that much in three months.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:08.600
Nice to see you again.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.430
Why, Mana and Rikka! Doing well, I take it?

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.810
And you two might be?

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:16.260
Kenzaki Makoto and Madoka Aguri.

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:17.590
Nice to meet you.

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.300
Glorious!

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:23.290
You two beauties have what it takes to be international superstars!

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:29.360
And father, I take it by your sudden return that...

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:31.960
Yes, something urgent came up.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:36.340
As such, could I ask you to attend the banquet with the president in my stead?

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.890
It would make for a lovely afternoon.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.000
Thank you.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.040
I must fly to Switzerland posthaste.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.340
Well girls, have a wonderful evening!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.830
The president?

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.320
Switzerland?

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.160
Wow!

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:58.430
Alice's Daddy Arrives! 

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:58.430
Alice's Daddy Arrives! 

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:05.100
I never knew your father was such a prestigious man.

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:10.400
Alice's daddy is the CEO of the international Yotsuba Conglomerate!

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:12.310
Do you know what a CEO is?

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.010
No I do not!

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:20.380
But Alice, isn't it tough to help your father out so much?

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:23.450
It may be, but it's fun as well.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.630
Besides, it's all to make my dream come true.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:26.440
Your dream?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:27.360
Yes.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.830
It's my dream to bring smiles to people around the world.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.720
That's great!

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:37.710
And it was Mana who gave me that dream.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:38.470
Huh?

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:40.670
What did I do, again?

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.310
I'd very much like to hear this story!

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:46.570
Then I'd be delighted to tell it.

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:51.010
It all began when I was still six...

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:54.580
I was in poorer health back then,

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.750
so I always played alone in my home's garden.

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.400
Careful!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.280
You okay?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.270
Yes...

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.450
Um... you are?

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.080
Shh!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.750
You like butterflies?

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:34.620
Yes...

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:37.020
Mana!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.260
Trespassing is wrong!

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:44.140
I was chasing that butterfly.

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:46.660
I'm sorry.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.620
Don't worry.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:48.130
Besides...

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.350
I'm sure it's better this way.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:57.340
Hey,

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:01.210
I know a place you can find a buncha butterflies at.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:02.310
Wanna come?

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:03.790
Huh? But I...

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:07.250
Sorry, I guess you're busy.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:08.820
No...

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:13.130
I'd... like to go.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.460
Then let's go!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.440
Right!

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:23.820
Madam!

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:25.230
Leave her be.

00:05:25.230 --> 00:05:26.700
Sebastian!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.680
I shall take all responsibility.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.200
You okay?

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:52.210
I actually know all about you.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.620
She sees you from outside the gate.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.170
But you never ever left your garden...

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:01.830
I'm... not very healthy,

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:05.780
so my father tells me not to leave the house.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.580
Oh, really?

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:09.270
Did we do something bad?

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:10.430
Don't worry.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:14.070
I've never had so much fun in my life!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.660
You okay?

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.620
This is nothing.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:22.640
But now I wanna go to a bunch of different places!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:23.540
Really?

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:25.190
Then let's go!

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.100
Okay!

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:27.860
I'm Aida Mana!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.070
I'm Hishikawa Rikka!

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.560
I'm Alice...

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:36.540
Yotsuba Alice!

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:41.270
And that was how we met.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:49.920
I frequently snuck away from home ever since to play with Mana and Rikka.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.990
What's this?

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.560
Something I built with Rikka.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:20.120
It's our secret base!

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.550
It's not finished, though.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:27.350
So let's all finish it together!

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:28.700
I'd love to help!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.280
Then let's pinky swear!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.090
Sure!

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.640
I would have loved to...

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:40.990
but that night, I came down with a fever.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:46.550
I've just returned.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.040
Sir.

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.010
Sebastian...

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.750
This was under your watch?

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.390
I deeply apologize.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:55.730
Is Alice all right?

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:57.390
Father...

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.220
How could this happen?

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:01.550
Well...

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.600
She hasn't come out in a while.

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:10.720
Did something happen?

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:14.810
Miss Alice can no longer play with you.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.780
She will be moving to a foreign country.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:21.090
But why?

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:26.960
Her father decided that she needed a new environment for the sake of her health.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:28.790
When's she leaving?

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.400
Today, and quite soon.

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:32.520
No!

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:41.100
Madam, it's time to go.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.050
Okay.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.210
Mana, Rikka...

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.520
I'm sorry.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.210
Alice!

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:05.390
Why are you two here?

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:08.610
We heard you were moving away!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.340
Why are you leaving?

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:15.110
I didn't do as my father told me.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.810
So, you're really leaving?

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:21.240
He said it was for my own good.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.490
So, we're not finishing the base?

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.540
I want to finish it!

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:30.320
But I can't go against my father...

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:32.330
Alice...

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:35.020
what do you want?

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:35.820
Huh?

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.100
I...

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:41.490
I...

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:44.730
Alice, we're leaving.

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:46.730
Father!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.140
Mana!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.680
What's wrong?

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.650
I'm sorry, but I can't!

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:55.740
Who's there?

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:59.850
Oh, you must be the one who took Alice outside!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.310
Open the door, Alice.

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:03.250
Alice!

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.630
Alice...

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:06.570
I...

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:07.710
I...

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.670
want to stay here.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:24.140
I want to stay with Mana and Rikka!

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.140
Alice!

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:31.100
Then you leave me no choice.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:33.900
Please, wait.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:37.570
Excellent timing! Help us.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.220
I cannot.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:40.590
What?!

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:45.940
My duty is to ensure Madam's happiness.

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.570
If one should wish to steal that from her,

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:53.540
then I would defend her from <i>any</i> foe.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.290
Oh, I see.

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:58.640
So you were the one who let Alice's friends in.

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:02.660
Well, let's see how much your duty means to you!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.450
Forgive me, Sebastian!

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:07.040
Servant Fist, Third Style!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.110
Swallowtail Dance!

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:11.830
Ha, well done!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.190
But how long can you hold out?

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.730
Sebastian!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:17.170
Rikka, got anything?

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:18.480
Is that...

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:20.130
The butler gave it to us.

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.510
He said it'd help us learn about your house!

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:24.600
Okay, I think I've got it!

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:25.970
Alice...

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:28.530
let's go outside!

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.010
Yes!

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:48.220
Alice!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.140
Search for her.

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:56.080
She couldn't have gone far.

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:00.490
Madam...

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.040
I never knew we had a secret tunnel.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:07.340
This house actually has a ton of them.

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:08.720
There they are!

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.790
What now?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:13.580
Just trust me!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.260
This way!

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:25.120
Hurry!

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:28.210
There! {Home Alone, the anime.}

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:42.580
Now's our chance!

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.420
Alice!

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:49.780
Stop right there!

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:51.360
Alice!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:52.890
Father!

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.720
Stop!

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:57.630
I'm sorry!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.990
Alice!

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:13.080
<i>Alice... since when could you run so fast?</i>

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:15.050
Just a little more!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.690
No...

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.950
Alice...

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:29.460
Please, don't take Alice with you!

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.520
I was surprised.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.730
I didn't know you'd become so healthy.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.530
Yes...

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:44.380
Ever since meeting Mana and Rikka, I've gotten much better.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.750
Do you like these girls?

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:49.810
Yes.

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:55.450
Father, I want to stay here.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:59.740
I want to stay with Mana and Rikka!

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:04.400
Madam has changed.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:08.430
The fact that she stands with her friends before you now...

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:11.410
shows just how far she's come. {ugh, kagayaki is a weird word. Pretty sure this works.}

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.290
Sebastian...

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:19.320
Alice, this is the first time you've fought back against me.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.140
But...

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.820
for some reason, I couldn't be happier.

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.120
Father...

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:29.020
Take good care of Alice, you two.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.490
Sure!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:35.230
But still, why would you two go so far for Alice?

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:36.690
Huh? Well...

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:42.060
if your friends are in trouble, isn't it normal to help them?

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:43.530
Besides...

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:49.870
Besides what?

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:55.670
It sounds like Father's leaving.

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:56.630
Alice!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:57.940
It's a Selfish!

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:05.750
Hey, what the heck're you doing?

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.280
This job can suck a fat one! {lit. "This job can eat shit," which is a bit spicy for children's cartoons.}

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.090
I'm gonna fly where I want!

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:16.520
I can't believe Bel would stick such an unfashionable ring on me!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.710
Now I need to take my anger out on something!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:19.450
Mammo!

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:21.970
Oh, there you are.

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:24.080
Father's helicopter!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:25.780
Lance!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.280
Lance!

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:33.580
Precure Love Link!

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:34.350
L-O-V-E!

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:35.030
L-O-V-E!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:35.740
L-O-V-E!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.910
L-O-V-E!

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:41.890
Precure Dress Up!

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:44.040
Kyupirappa!

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:15.670
Brimming with love,

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.910
Cure Heart!

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:22.110
The light of wisdom,

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:24.510
Cure Diamond!

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.490
The warmth of the sun,

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:30.960
Cure Rosetta!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.590
The blade of courage,

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:35.790
Cure Sword!

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:40.500
Love's trump card,

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:41.940
Cure Ace!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:47.030
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.460
Dokidoki Precure!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.030
Oh poor helicopter who has lost his love,

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.210
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:58.740
will make your heart race once more!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.840
Go ahead and try!

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:02.770
Rosetta, get your father!

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:05.040
Right!

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.320
<i>Father...</i>

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.830
Sir!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.950
Please leave him to me.

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:28.730
I shall.

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:30.500
<i>Thank goodness he's safe.</i>

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:32.060
Very well.

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:33.690
You...

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:37.070
Who are you?

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:39.600
A Precure.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.040
Cure Rosetta.

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:44.430
Cure... Rosetta?

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:48.650
Selfish!

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:53.420
He's strong!

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:59.330
I hate to admit it, but this thing packs a punch!

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:01.200
Finish them, Selfish!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:02.740
Selfish!

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:07.270
Self?

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:10.900
Rosetta!

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:14.340
You saved us!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.880
I'm here now!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.020
Selfishishishishish!

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.090
Self!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:45.880
Rosetta!

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:47.590
<i>Mana...</i>

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:50.980
<i>That was when you gave me that dream.</i>

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:56.850
Besides, when I see other people happy...

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:58.750
it makes me happy, too!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.410
<i>I want to...</i>

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:07.500
I want to be like Mana, too!

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:14.470
Self?!

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:31.680
Self...

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:33.350
Could you try <i>doing</i> something?

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:38.090
I want to see people smile from everything I do in life!

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:43.040
I want to fill the world with smiles through love!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.740
So, come...

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:49.140
You and I will nurture that love! {ugh this line again whyyyy. Well, I don't hate it as much now that I don't have to retranslate it, but still.}

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:51.620
Huh? What?!

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:54.480
Rosetta Balloon!

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:57.180
A one, two, and three!

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.850
Self!

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:06.960
Whatever pops out of the Rosetta Balloon is a surprise every time!

00:20:23.190 --> 00:20:26.050
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:42.690
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:55.220
Love love looooove!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.580
What the heck?! I <i>still</i> lost!

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:07.190
I saw your mother at the opera house in Paris.

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:08.940
Was she well?

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:09.750
Very.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:13.160
She said she hopes to see you at her next performance.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:14.380
Performance?

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:17.730
Alice's mother is a famous opera singer.

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:19.930
Well, I'll be off.

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:20.860
Goodbye.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:23.470
Oh, and could you give someone a message?

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:29.400
Protecting smiles is all well and good, but try to stay out of harm's way.

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:32.380
Who might that be for?

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:35.450
For Cure Rosetta, of course.

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:38.990
Very well.

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:42.800
Well girls, have a wonderful evening!

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:48.900
Alice.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:50.950
Let's go back.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:54.730
We still haven't heard the end of that story.

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:56.760
Ah.

00:21:57.150 --> 00:21:58.450
You're quite right.

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:03.920
{ED}

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:09.690
Ai won't stop crying!

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:11.140
Maybe she's hungry?

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:12.510
Here's your milkie!

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:13.940
Maybe she needs a diaper change?

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:16.410
I don't think that's it, either.

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.980
Girls, we have trouble!

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.250
What is it, Aguri?

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:23.620
Ai's having a temper tantrum, and the Selfishes have powered up!

00:22:23.620 --> 00:22:25.430
Huh? What do we do?!

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:28.320
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:31.290
Being a Mommy's Tough!

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:31.290
Being a Mommy's Tough!

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:33.770
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
